WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.250
- So it seems the Trump
Department of Justice

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:05.230
was up to even more shady
things then we knew about,

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.490
not only did the Trump
DOJ subpoena Twitter

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:09.217
to unmask the person who was behind

00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:11.830
an anonymous Devin Nunes' parody account.

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:15.330
Not only did the Trump
DOJ get the phone records

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.500
for three reporters
for the Washington Post

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.350
who covered the FBI Russia Investigation.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.640
But on top of that, the
Trump DOJ also secretly

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.170
obtained the phone and email records

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.370
for CNN Pentagon
correspondent, Barbara Starr.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:32.000
The Trump DOJ procured emails
and phone records from 2017,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.610
it's not at all clear why they
were after this information

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.600
or whether it was part
of an investigation,

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.750
but this is an incredibly
disturbing pattern

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.700
that is arising that
the Trump DOJ was going

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.930
after reporters for seemingly
no reason whatsoever.

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:45.010
But it's not like former President Trump

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:47.810
ever said that reporters
are the enemy of the people.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:51.350
- I call the fake news the enemy
of the people and they are.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:52.430
- Crap.

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:53.420
We'll see what happens

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.483
and if any of this ends up in court.

